Vml("ConfirmDialog", "Installing to a partition changes your real disk and can leave your PC unbootable if interrupted.\n\nHave a recovery USB ready before you do this.\n\n(Coming soon - not yet enabled.)", "Advanced: install to a partition")
Vml("SetStatusText", "Install to a partition: coming later (advanced)")
LUA

